  "body": "Nineteen migration manifest entries identified ancestor commits whose trees did not yet contain the registered SQL path. This corrects only those `introducedBy` SHAs to ancestor commits that first added the actual files. Migration IDs, paths, ordering, SQL contents, checksums and release ancestry checks remain unchanged.\n\nValidation:53 production-release tests and12 CI-pipeline tests passed; direct Git verification proves all102 manifest introductions are ancestors and contain their SQL path. The19 corrections preserve every other manifest field. No deployment, database mutation or shared-history rewrite occurred.\n\n| Migration | Previous introduction | Correct file introduction |\n|---|---|---|\n| 2026-07-12_ticketing_runtime_schema | `4ec247f222ec6b6b6e91a7fb0829b1ebbd463d32` | `4ed9a0826f9f1924422dabe45a6b569bbf02968d` |\n| 2026-07-15_social_sync_runtime_schema | `f4805f72b4749029741373798da659566b5c4ea5` | `22073e900aa0c8edadcc6f4682366ecf7f760363` |\n| 2026-07-21_event_logistics | `5121f69a7d4535db89d2f6bba432061fc6063190` | `8b4ba1edf9248ca70a895b8b6a12d9a47c741dbc` |\n| 2026-07-30_event_city_subscriptions | `54009732c8ac9d2a4e7b6912b5ec1ed9dd5d945e` | `a0e130a06e97497006e89a785e0c3da2c252df99` |\n| 2026-08-05_platform_internationalization | `6f5ef3468c6d8fe3a0f8de754430459b3af66569` | `79d88cacc8baf2eb9bf670c87f15ceedd4342f5e` |\n| 2026-08-05_artist_promotion_slots | `6f5ef3468c6d8fe3a0f8de754430459b3af66569` | `45bd44ec73787b71b491bcfb9a43c4cde1b62a59` |\n| 2026-08-06_feature_access_requests | `1e1387d564b2bd9b5b25a7e5f83d8d22ba35983c` | `b3d952079b759886ff4454edf926d81aa3c1db0b` |\n| 2026-08-06_feature_navigation_preferences | `1e1387d564b2bd9b5b25a7e5f83d8d22ba35983c` | `b3d952079b759886ff4454edf926d81aa3c1db0b` |\n| 2026-08-20_verified_experience_reviews | `dad0ca237b737bdeee5ec87970c2bbfe846e1450` | `bf0c1b2abc0d5488efb9218639393c470f4563ec` |\n| 2026-08-21_studio_internship_audit | `dac84b099b18b51032fb94f58273120f5375eb85` | `d68b794e531501589e18c24dbb60aa00ada0a0f7` |\n| 2026-08-24_ticket_qr_constraint_compatibility | `dac84b099b18b51032fb94f58273120f5375eb85` | `be0b3a36d9c659a3d343907036a92d0d5c947e96` |\n| 2026-08-24_studio_audit_completion_exception | `dac84b099b18b51032fb94f58273120f5375eb85` | `e73f91871f81682ef96266a73ed9d4f2092c1ae1` |\n| 2026-08-24_studio_audit_historical_failure_gate | `dac84b099b18b51032fb94f58273120f5375eb85` | `f0ea79a2304202c0bb8c55dcc4c91f5b57aeb4ab` |\n| 2026-09-08_studio_audit_historical_failure_gate_repair | `dac84b099b18b51032fb94f58273120f5375eb85` | `46f6ecdc78e49c6745fd2c9450c5763dc60d71dd` |\n| 2026-09-02_party_selector_search_indexes | `88d2d847211c410793712135b7376f3f1924d5dd` | `442f758a6f901ea5151f13783ce21042302750a4` |\n| 2026-09-08_notification_notif_type_not_null_repair | `7bee4009634844fe20a02bd3bce09eeb4bdb05e3` | `d5ecbf3f97f62940c7d66537e5b9a1141c45128c` |\n| 2026-09-08_notification_notif_type_text_compatibility | `7bee4009634844fe20a02bd3bce09eeb4bdb05e3` | `714060ffcc1db56448f6d3cb82e055e0085af4e7` |\n| 2026-09-07_service_storefront_package_bounds_repair | `48992e37f83ac6c6f45d4f1a2a4888c6bf41bd2f` | `e84cfa0e495034a0b321e3510cd84611609bcc76` |\n| 2026-09-07_catalog_slug_alias_integrity_revalidation | `b4e0706cd60693379b6891c6c48b7fec4b4ab185` | `349bd9ba4f8e63b43a4046538083ef9c6b8aec96` |\n",
